The operative portion of the order dated 20.11.2025 reads as follows:
"CONCLUSION :
15.Thus, considering the :
(i) specific provisions of Section 37 of the Act of 2006, which specifically requires the Commissioner to notify the appointment of FSO ;
(ii) Rule 2.1.3 of the Rules of 2011 which requires for possessing the requisite qualification on the date on which he is so appointed ;
(iii) the Training Manual, which refers to Section 37 of the Act of2006 and Rule 2.1.3 of the Rules of 2011 and provides for an induction training to the FSOs who are newly recruited ; and (iv) clarification issued by the FSSAI dated 03.10.2018
